
>> shop := (Phau-txhais-lus tshiab
	muab: ['magazine'] rau: ['books'],
	muab: ['computer'] rau: ['electronics'],
	muab: ['lipstick'] rau: ['cosmetics']
).
Tawm sau-ntawv: (shop muaj-nyob-hauv: ['computer']), kab-tshiab. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: (shop muaj-nyob-hauv: ['sausage']), kab-tshiab. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: (shop muaj-nyob-hauv: ['computers']), kab-tshiab. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: (shop muaj-nyob-hauv: ['compute']), kab-tshiab. 
Tawm sau-ntawv: (shop muaj-nyob-hauv: ['2computer']), kab-tshiab. 
